  - m_Id: 23009046576
    m_Localized: 'The hegemony of gold that moves the world pulses even more powerfully
      at the humans'' fingertips.\nOwn Human Towers: <color=#FF4545>[{0} / {1} /
      {2} / {3}]</color>\nIncreases Interest Rate by <color=#FF4545>[{4} / {5} /
      {6} / {7}]%p</color> at the end of the round.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046578
    m_Localized: 'The mystical energy of nature connects spirits and Elves as one.\nOwn
      Elf Towers: <color=#FF4545>[{0} / {1} / {2} / {3}]</color>\nIncreases ATK of
      all Elf towers by <color=#FF4545>[{4} / {5} / {6} / {7}]</color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046580
    m_Localized: 'Dwarven precision strikes pierce through the enemy''s toughest
      parts.\nOwn Dwarf Towers: <color=#FF4545>[{0} / {1} / {2}]</color>\nReduces
      enemy Defense by <color=#FF4545>[{3} / {4} / {5}]%</color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046582
    m_Localized: 'With a fierce roar, the overwhelming might of the Orcs crushes
      the battlefield.\nOrc Towers Owned: <color=#FF4545>[{0} / {1} / {2} / {3}]\nATK
      increased by <color=#FF4545>[{4} / {5} / {6}]\nTier 4: Inflicts <color=#45A2FF>Slow
      on attack (Reduces enemy Move Speed by <color=#FF4545>{7}% for <color=#45A2FF>{8}
      sec)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046584
    m_Localized: 'Ancient split dragon factors pulse hotly within the veins of Dragonians.\nOwn
      Dragonian Towers: <color=#FF4545>[{0} / {1} / {2} / {3} / {4} / {5}]</color>\nIncreases
      ATK of all Dragonian towers by <color=#FF4545>[{6} / {7} / {8} / {9} / {10}
      / {11}]</color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046586
    m_Localized: 'The Werebeast''s eyes, flashing even in the dark, never miss their
      prey.\nOwn Werebeast Towers: <color=#FF4545>[{0} / {1} / {2} / {3}]</color>\nIncreases
      Critical Chance by <color=#FF4545>[{4} / {5} / {6} / {7}]%p</color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
